Description: Implements predictive linear discriminant analysis (LDA) through an
    R6 class whose interface follows the 'scikit-learn' conventions: fit(),
    predict(), predict_proba(), evaluate(), relevance(), print() and summary().
    Supports numeric and categorical predictors, optional forward selection and
    regularisation of the within-class covariance. The linear classification
    functions (one per class) are exposed for interpretation.
